WEBVTT

00:46:50.000 --> 00:46:54.219
Nancy Shukla: Very good, repeat after me. Saraswati,

00:46:55.400 --> 00:46:56.400
Student: Saraswati.

00:46:57.260 --> 00:46:58.639
Nancy Shukla: Namastubhyam,

00:46:59.259 --> 00:47:00.599
Student: Namastubhyam.

00:47:01.679 --> 00:47:06.619
Nancy Shukla: It means that we are saying Namaste to Goddess Saraswati, right? What are we doing?

00:47:08.280 --> 00:47:15.340
Student: Say Namaste to the Goddess!

00:47:16.619 --> 00:47:21.900
Nancy Shukla: That's the thing. We are saying Namaste. Now tell me, with what sound we start our prayer?

00:47:44.280 --> 00:47:57.400
Nancy Shukla: Big Om! We stretch the sound of Om, very good! Now, who are we praying to?

00:47:58.480 --> 00:47:59.860
Student: Saraswati!

00:48:00.780 --> 00:48:04.119
Nancy Shukla: Very good, and now what are we gonna say next?

00:48:04.840 --> 00:48:06.900
Student: Namastubhyam Varade!

00:48:07.289 --> 00:48:20.000
Nancy Shukla: Super! Perfect! You remembered those two words, very good! Now the next word is Varade. Varade means asking for her blessings!

